      "width": 410,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## Maryland OTC Inventory (1,003 Unique Parcels)\n- **Cecil:** `587` parcels (`taxsale@cecilcountymd.gov` | `410-996-5385`)\n- **Prince George's:** `207` (`TAXSALE@CO.PG.MD.US` | `301-952-3948`, **20% non-owner**)\n- **Anne Arundel:** `106` (`29` viable Grade A, `64` Grade B)\n- **Kent:** `54` (`7` Tier-1 Alpha | `financeinfo@kentgov.org`)\n- **Wicomico:** `42` (`finance@wicomicocounty.org`)\n- **Worcester:** `5` | **Queen Anne's:** `2`\n- **Baltimore City:** Sub-$333 OTC (`18%` interest, `buyintobmore.baltimorecity.gov`)",
      "color": "2"
    },
