      "text": "## Anne Arundel OTC Direct Buy Picks\n- **Email:** `taxsale@aacounty.org` | **Tel:** `(410) 222-1735`\n- **Finance:** `financeinfo@aacounty.org` | `(410) 222-1144`\n- **Sub-$1k Picks:**\n  - `#749` (`500202604103` Henry Ave) \u2014 **$383.57** / $30.9k W2 (1.24% LTV)\n  - `#58` (`188090034122` Galesville slip) \u2014 **$436.99** / $28.7k (1.52% LTV)\n  - `#283` (`311990041926` 843 W Benfield Rd) \u2014 **$901.75**\n- **Single-Parcel Commercial:** `#528` (`400001785100` Dare St Odenton, **$1,974.30** / $450.8k = **0.44% LTV**), `#742` (**$1,011.58**), `#747` (**$1,845.76**)\n- **7-Lot Assembly:** `#430, #434-#439` (145-169 Forest Rd, **$8,818.39** total / $654.2k assmt)",
