    {
      "id": "co_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 385,
      "y": -870,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 235,
      "text": "## Colorado 2026 Enriched Portfolio (`473` Parcels)\n- **Conejos County:** `174` parcels (`78` A, `53` B | `99` Sub-$1k A/B) \u2014 Live TylerHost + 2026 SLVGIS polygon centroids\n- **Gilpin County:** `126` parcels (`21` A, `7` B | `15` Sub-$1k A/B) \u2014 Live InfoEnvoy Assessor + GIS (`R*` real vs `N*` MRO)\n- **Gunnison County:** `173` parcels (`87` A, `12` B | `17` Sub-$1k A/B) \u2014 `$61.25M` actual value on `$777.3k` face bids\n- **Combined Sub-$1k Grade A/B Flip Queue:** **`131` deals**\n- **Dossier Links:** Every parcel includes Assessor Card, Treasurer Tax Account & GPS Maps Pin.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
