      "type": "text",
      "x": 825,
      "y": -870,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 235,
      "text": "## $5k Budget, Ag Ranch & Trap Rules\n- **Gunnison $5k Budget Plan:** 5 Grade A improved lots (`$4,931.14` direct / `$5,000` max proxy) backed by `$1.80M` value (`$690/yr` @ 14%)\n- **Ag Grazing Assessment Anomaly (C.R.S. \u00a7 39-1-103(5)(a)):**\n  - `R072243` (35.02 ac Ohio Creek Valley): `$14k` Ag roll / **$320k sold comp** (`$233.03` lien)\n  - `R071510 / R071511 / R033389` (223.2 ac Hwy 149): **$320k comp** (`$769.54` combined)\n- **Conejos 40-80 Ac Flips & Trap Avoidance:** Reject Conejos `5170` severed mineral (`R017432`) & Gilpin `N*` mining claims (`0` surface acres).",
      "color": "4"
