      "y": 290,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## Multi-State Tax Sale & Land Corridors\n- **Virginia (95 Counties / 38 Cities):** Judicial (`Va Code \u00a7 58.1-3965`) & Nonjudicial (`\u00a7 58.1-3975`) Tax Deeds \u2014 **0 post-sale redemption**; Special Commissioner deeds.\n- **Hampton Roads VA Land:** Chesapeake, Hampton, Yorktown, Poquoson perc/public utility infill lots (`$30k/$60k/$90k` buy boxes).\n- **Delaware Monition Sales:** New Castle, Kent, Sussex sheriff sales (`1-yr` redemption @ **15% penalty**).\n- **New Jersey Municipalities:** `564` towns (`0%` bid-down + premium, `2-yr` redemption).\n- **Indiana (Fulton County):** Nov 2026 Sheriff Sale routing integrated into parcel engine.",
