      "y": 290,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## Core Deal Rules & Monetization Engines\n- **4-Stage Due Diligence Funnel:** SDAT -> GIS/Flood/Perc -> PACER Bankruptcy/Liens -> MAO (< 30% LTV target).\n- **Title & Exit:** Quiet Title / Tax Title Services (TTS) certification -> **Seller Financing / Land Contracts** (Contract for Deed, triple-net buyer maintenance, Dodd-Frank checks).\n- **Analyzed Property Dossiers:** `1883 Cedar Dr (Severn MD)`, `629 Queenstown Rd`, `19036 Chandlee Mill Rd`, `27040 Oxley Dr`, `Glen Dr (Westminster)`, `Dennett Rd (Oakland)`, `Araby Church Rd`.\n- **Multifamily Benchmarks:** South FL Q2 2026 (`Miami 4.75% cap`, `Ft Lauderdale 5.10%`, `West Palm Beach 5.25%`).",
